Again one easily construct the stable representation in $\R{\alv}{\Po}^{\thv-s}$ with respect to the choice of $\thv$ given by formulas <<ref:canocinalStab>>. For instance, the following representation is $\thv$-stable (we use the same notation as in Section 4)

$$
(K^4;K_1,K_2,K_3,K_{1,2,34},K_{1,2,3},K_{2,3,14},K_{3,14},K_{12,34}).
$$

Therefore the moduli spaces $\M{\Po}{\alv}^{\thv-s}$ is non-empty and by dimension formula <<ref:dimFormula>> we have $\dim \M{\Po}{\alv}^{\thv-s}=2$, as $\Bf{\Po}(\alv,\alv)=-1$.
